            "\\title{\\look Decoding for Open-Ended Text Generation}\n",
            "\\author{Nan Xu$^\\diamondsuit$, Chunting Zhou$^\\spadesuit$, Asli Celikyilmaz$^\\spadesuit$, Xuezhe Ma$^\\diamondsuit$\\\\\n",
            "$^\\diamondsuit$University of Southern California, $^\\spadesuit$Meta AI\\\\\n",
