            "\\subsection{Case Study}\n",
            "Given a prefix sampled from WikiText-103, we present truncated human continuations as well as generations from \\look and SimCTG in \\Cref{tab:case_study}\n",
            "and leave more examples in Appendix \\Cref{tab:case_study_more}. \n",
